{"title":"오렌지","artist":"토마","sourceId":"reference:dqbYH347EQN3HQGOP8i1","sourceHash":"689ab171a03bc531bc749f1c99612f669e6de8b05bb6259fb63aa3c2e3d70a59","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":8138666,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":0.26,"end":3.05,"text":"君のいる世界で笑ったこと","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":3.05,"end":5.55,"text":"君の見る未来を恨んだこと","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":5.55,"end":37.4,"text":"君の声 温もり 態度 愛のすべてが...","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":37.4,"end":40.26,"text":"海街 赤錆びた線路沿い","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":40.26,"end":43.0,"text":"二人「幸せだ」って嘘ついて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":43.0,"end":45.69,"text":"くしゃくしゃに笑う顔 繋いだ手","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":45.69,"end":48.56,"text":"遠くの島 朝焼け","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":48.56,"end":50.98,"text":"愛しきれない君のこと","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":50.98,"end":53.57,"text":"つられて泣く私も弱いこと","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":53.57,"end":55.22,"text":"代わりなんてないって","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":55.22,"end":58.72,"text":"特別だって 許し合えた日も","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":58.72,"end":63.97,"text":"もう二人に明日がないことも","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":63.97,"end":66.86,"text":"ただ ずっとそう ずっと","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":66.86,"end":73.74,"text":"隠してしまおう 残される君に届く","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":73.74,"end":79.06,"text":"ただひとつを 今でも 探してる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":79.06,"end":81.61,"text":"「元気でいますか。」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":81.61,"end":84.86,"text":"「笑顔は枯れてませんか。」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":84.86,"end":90.28,"text":"「他の誰かを深く深く、愛せていますか。」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":90.28,"end":94.25999999999999,"text":"ずっと来るはずない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":94.25999999999999,"end":109.55,"text":"君との日を願ったこと 鍵かけて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":109.55,"end":112.22999999999999,"text":"三日月島 陰る渚鳥","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":112.22999999999999,"end":114.94,"text":"ツタに飾られた教会裏で","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":114.94,"end":117.6,"text":"また子供じみた約束しては","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":117.6,"end":120.58,"text":"逃げ出す話をしよう。","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":120.58,"end":122.94,"text":"誰も満たされないよりも","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":122.94,"end":125.69,"text":"望んだ最後だけを温める","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":125.69,"end":130.83,"text":"怖い夢を見ただけの私に そうであったように","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":130.83,"end":135.99,"text":"許すだけでも 耐え抜くだけでも","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":135.99,"end":138.91,"text":"ただ きっと そう きっと","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":138.91,"end":141.97,"text":"誰も変われないこと。","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":141.97,"end":148.45,"text":"傷付けない弱さが生きられないほど","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":148.45,"end":151.16,"text":"大きく育ったの。","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":151.16,"end":156.72,"text":"覚えていますか 初めて会ったことも","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":156.72,"end":160.25,"text":"君の嘘も 甘えも 弱さも","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":160.25,"end":166.53,"text":"流してゆくような この朝焼けで","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":166.53,"end":169.52,"text":"あの日のように君はまた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":169.52,"end":171.14,"text":"素敵に変わってゆく","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":171.14,"end":173.9,"text":"愛を歌った 大地を蹴った 今","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":173.9,"end":176.5,"text":"「最低だ」って殺した最後も","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":176.5,"end":179.01,"text":"不完全だって不確かになって","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":179.01,"end":186.42,"text":"ほら蹴っ飛ばしてないや 歳月が巡って 声を辿って また生まれ変わったら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":186.42,"end":209.63,"text":"真っ先に君に会いに行こう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":209.63,"end":215.59,"text":"愛していました 最後までこの日まで","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":215.59,"end":218.28,"text":"それでも終わりにするのは","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":218.28,"end":225.97,"text":"私なのですか 君の幸せな未来を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":225.97,"end":229.85,"text":"ただ、願ってる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":229.85,"end":241.2,"text":"君のいる世界で笑ったこと、 君の見る未来を恨んだこと、 君の声、温もり、態度、愛のすべてに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":241.2,"end":243.13,"text":"さよなら。","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}